WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.200
Next, the API key.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.600
Create a key in Google AI Studio,
then click the copy button.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.200
Paste the key and click "Apply" — you're connected!

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.800
Any charges go to your own Google account.
